{"code": 20000, "message": "OK", "data": {"items": [{"id": 15044, "public_date": 0, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "报道：卓胜微全系列RF产品9月1日起调价", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 据报道，国内射频前端龙头企业卓胜微向全体客户及合作伙伴正式发布产品调价通知函，宣布对公司全系列 RF 产品执行价格调整，本次调价将于2026 年 9 月 1 日正式生效。"}, {"id": 15043, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "美国", "title": "报道：高通自9月1日起产品价格上调两位数", "event": "", "country_id": "US", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 综合媒体报道，受全球供应链持续紧缺及上游零部件成本大幅攀升影响，美国芯片制造商高通公司（Qualcomm）于当地时间周五向客户发送书面通知函，宣布自9月1日起对相关发货产品实施两位数百分比的价格上调。"}, {"id": 15031, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "美国", "title": "特朗普扩大瘦牛肉碎免关税配额 9/1起(90天)", "event": "", "country_id": "US", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 2, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 美国自9月1日起将瘦牛肉碎月免关税配额扩至10万吨、为期90天。据白宫公告，此举缓和肉类通胀，关注农产品贸易与食品价格边际。"}, {"id": 15029, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "日本", "title": "太阳诱电上调MLCC价格/三菱刀具调价", "event": "", "country_id": "JP", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9c75dc68-fcc8-42e2-8146-b8d53152e6e7.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 9月1日起太阳诱电上调MLCC价格、三菱调整硬质合金刀具报价。据报道，被动元件与刀具涨价延续，反映电子与制造链成本传导，关注相关国产替代。"}, {"id": 15027, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "百度港股美股双重主要上市生效", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 4, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 百度香港联交所及纳斯达克双重主要上市将于9月1日生效。据公司公告，此举提升两地流动性与融资弹性，中概股回归标杆意义延续，关注港股科技板块情绪。"}, {"id": 15026, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "《2026版国家基本药物目录》实施", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 《2026年版国家基本药物目录》将于9月1日起实施。据国家医保局，新版目录调整涉及品种扩容与结构优化，影响医药企业产品准入与放量节奏，基药独家品种厂家受益预期升温。"}, {"id": 15014, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "《银行保险机构资产管理产品信息披露管理办法》生效", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 《银行保险机构资产管理产品信息披露管理办法》将于9月1日实施，业绩比较基准由\"数值型/区间型\"改为\"公式型\"。据21财经，8月以来银行及理财子公司已密集发布3031条\"换锚\"公告。新规落地后理财信息披露规范化，关注理财规模与净值平稳过渡。"}, {"id": 14982, "public_date": 1788192000, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "美国", "title": "蒂姆·库克正式卸任苹果CEO，John Ternus接任", "event": "", "country_id": "US", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 4, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 蒂姆·库克（Tim Cook）将于2026年9月1日正式卸任苹果公司首席执行官（CEO）职务。卸任CEO后，库克不会离开苹果，他将出任公司执行董事长。现任硬件工程高级副总裁约翰·特努斯（John Ternus）将接任新一任CEO。"}, {"id": 1589104, "public_date": 1788217260, "observation_date": "2026-08-01", "wscn_ticker": "UK171660", "country": "英国", "title": "8月BRC商店价格指数同比", "event": "BRC商店价格指数同比", "country_id": "UK", "quantity": "", "unit": "%", "importance": 1, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3969b3d1-8eea-492e-8190-c4a9a710878d.jpg", "calendar_key": "df1f03dc2612a9c15dcca85a0d96490e", "actual": "1.5", "forecast": "", "previous": "0.9", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/UK171660/overview", "assets": "fx", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 1589105, "public_date": 1788220200, "observation_date": "2026-04-01", "wscn_ticker": "JP191915", "country": "日本", "title": "二季度企业资本支出同比", "event": "企业资本支出同比", "country_id": "JP", "quantity": "", "unit": "%", "importance": 1, "mark": "BB", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9c75dc68-fcc8-42e2-8146-b8d53152e6e7.jpg", "calendar_key": "67666d0ac983f83067e3067289fdf7f7", "actual"