 "cmd", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 15001, "public_date": 1788550200, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "美国", "title": "CFTC公布周度持仓报告。", "event": "", "country_id": "US", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 15002, "public_date": 1788580920, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "沙特阿拉伯", "title": "沙特阿美在每月5日左右公布官方原油售价。", "event": "", "country_id": "SA", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3530fc81-5f34-486a-9be5-342c532b700d.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 14964, "public_date": 1788667320, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "沙特阿拉伯", "title": "OPEC+ 七国月度会议", "event": "", "country_id": "SA", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/3530fc81-5f34-486a-9be5-342c532b700d.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 9月6日（周日）OPEC+七国举行月度会议，评估9月增产18.8万桶/日的执行与市场情况（据OPEC官网）。"}, {"id": 15128, "public_date": 1788710400, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "群核科技等获纳入港股通，百度纳入沪港通", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 上交所公告宣布Manycore Tech（简称“群核科技”）等正式调入沪港通下港股通标的名单，自9月7日起生效。百度集团在香港联交所发布公告称，据上海证券交易所当日发布的通知，百度A类普通股已获纳入沪港通下港股通标的证券，2026年9月7日生效。"}, {"id": 15046, "public_date": 1788710400, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "恒生指数成份股变动生效", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 2, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 恒生指数公司宣布，截至2026年6月30日之恒生指数系列季度检讨结果。恒生指数成份股数目将由93只增加至95只，加入华虹宏力、潍柴动力；恒生科技指数成份股数目维持30只，加入天数智芯，剔除同程旅行。恒生指数、恒生中国企业指数、恒生科技指数及恒生综合指数的成份股变动将于2026年9月4日（星期五）收市后实施，并于2026年9月7日（星期一）起生效。"}, {"id": 14991, "public_date": 1788710400, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "阿里云：云沙箱Snapshot（沙箱快照）功能正式开启商业化计费", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 2, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 阿里云公告，自北京时间2026年9月7日00:00起，云沙箱Snapshot（沙箱快照）功能正式开启商业化计费。Snapshot支持对运行中的沙箱进行全状态快照（含内存与磁盘），可基于快照秒级恢复沙箱或克隆出多个新沙箱。适用于长时间运行的Agent任务断点续跑、环境预热秒级冷启动、并行克隆探索等场景。"}, {"id": 15127, "public_date": 1788742800, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "中国央行：9月7日将开展5000亿元3月期限买断式逆回购操作", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | \n中国人民银行：2026年9月7日，中国人民银行将以固定数量、利率招标、多重价位中标方式开展5000亿元买断式逆回购操作，期限为3个月（89天），到期日为2026年12月5日。"}, {"id": 1590769, "public_date": 1788744600, "observation_date": "2026-08-01", "wscn_ticker": "AU122746", "country": "澳大利亚", "title": "8月ANZ招聘广告环比", "event": "ANZ招聘广告环比", "country_id": "AU", "quantity": "", "unit": "%", "importance": 1, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/dcb7cb6c-b858-48e9-934a-35addef7be1b.jpg", "calendar_key": "0f2492a9aa8418179015b394baf0ac20", "actual": "2.5", "forecast": "", "previous": "0.8", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/AU122746/overview", "assets": "fx", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 15114, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "德国", "title": "柏林国际消费电子展（IFA 2026），小米参展", "event": "", "country_id": "DE", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 3, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef7b465-a541-4a9b-bd14-d88983aa1f31.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 9月4日至8日，柏林国际消费电子展（IFA 2026）举行，小米将首次参展。小米首款中折叠旗舰手机小米18 Fold将一同发布。"}, {"id": 15076, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "Mysteel公布澳洲、巴西铁矿石发货量", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 15075, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "北方港口铁矿到港量", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 15034, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "9月机圈新品不断：华为苹果小米等集体上新", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 4, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 目前，华为Mate XT 2已确认将在9月7日发布，小米18 Fold也将在9月初登场，小米18 Pro系列则被雷军确认于9月底发布；vivo产品经理韩伯啸、荣耀CEO李健也都分别明确了vivo X500系列和荣耀Magic9系列将在9月发布；OPPO Find X10、华为Mate90和iQOO 16虽然尚未正式官宣时间，但入网、发布会审批以及供应链消息都指向9月。"}, {"id": 15033, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "华为全场景新品发布会，MateXT 2 三折叠发布", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 4, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 华为将于9月7日召开全场景新品发布会。8月25日，华为终端宣布华为新一代三折叠旗舰手机华为Mate XT 2定档9月7日发布，将首发搭载HarmonyOS 7操作系统。"}, {"id": 15017, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "美国", "title": "Anthropic IPO推迟", "event": "", "country_id": "US", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 4, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | Anthropic原计划最快于下周提交IPO招股说明书，目前推迟至9月下旬。上市路演最早10月中旬启动，目标在11月中期选举前完成挂牌。此次延期与公司正在敲定的150亿美元信贷额度相关，需待融资落实后方可推进后续流程。市场对其最高估值看至2万亿美元，有望跻身史上最大规模IPO之列。"}, {"id": 14998, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "", "wscn_ticker": "", "country": "中国", "title": "APEC北京能源会议周将于9/7-9/11举行", "event": "", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 2, "mark": "", "push_status": false, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "", "actual": "", "forecast": "", "previous": "", "revised": "", "period": "", "calendar_type": "FE", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "", "assets": "", "foresight": "前瞻 | 北京商报记者从会上获悉，2026年第16次能源部长会议、第72次能源工作组会议暨相关会议将于9月在北京市国家会议中心二期举办，这是继2014年之后，我国时隔12年再次主办APEC能源部长会议。本次会议紧扣“共筑普惠、创新、协同的亚太能源共同体”的能源主题，围绕“高质量能源普遍服务”“人工智能+能源”“亚太能源协同共治”三大优先方向开展务实合作。"}, {"id": 1590781, "public_date": 1788753720, "observation_date": "2026-08-01", "wscn_ticker": "CN191467", "country": "中国", "title": "8月外汇储备(亿美元)", "event": "外汇储备", "country_id": "CN", "quantity": "b", "unit": "亿美元", "importance": 4, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef1c0c9-42b2-420a-b2f0-661a89ba8876.jpg", "calendar_key": "4fa41dde91aeba9ac473de83d17a3cb2", "actual": "34383.2", "forecast": "", "previous": "34187.8", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/CN191467/overview", "assets": "cmd,fx,bd,stk@cn", "foresight": "前瞻 | 国家统计局将于9月9日发布8月物价数据。华创证券张瑜团队预计CPI同比回升至0.9%左右。中国海关总署将于同日公布8月进出口数据。看点是AI产业链支撑的高景气能否延续，以及“抢出口”退坡后的动能变化，直接影响外贸与航运板块预期。下周，8月金融数据也预计出炉。此外，国家外汇管理局将于9月7日公布8月末外汇储备，7月末为34187.8亿美元，央行再度增持黄金。"}, {"id": 1590771, "public_date": 1788757200, "observation_date": "2026-07-01", "wscn_ticker": "JP151830", "country": "日本", "title": "7月同步指标初值", "event": "同步指标", "country_id": "JP", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9c75dc68-fcc8-42e2-8146-b8d53152e6e7.jpg", "calendar_key": "1ec2d4a662ff32c26bc6cf190e83522c", "actual": "120.6", "forecast": "120.2", "previous": "118.5", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/JP151830/overview", "assets": "fx", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 1590770, "public_date": 1788757200, "observation_date": "2026-07-01", "wscn_ticker": "JP151829", "country": "日本", "title": "7月领先指标初值", "event": "领先指标", "country_id": "JP", "quantity": "", "unit": "", "importance": 1, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9c75dc68-fcc8-42e2-8146-b8d53152e6e7.jpg", "calendar_key": "c3781e04946191feb3cba65b1a589582", "actual": "117.9", "forecast": "118", "previous": "116.5", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/JP151829/overview", "assets": "fx", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 1590773, "public_date": 1788760800, "observation_date": "2026-07-01", "wscn_ticker": "DE142208", "country": "德国", "title": "7月工业产出同比", "event": "工业产出同比", "country_id": "DE", "quantity": "", "unit": "%", "importance": 2, "mark": "BB", "push_status": true, "flag_uri": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cef7b465-a541-4a9b-bd14-d88983aa1f31.jpg", "calendar_key": "c93b1940dd908600b53736e8582c222a", "actual": "-1.6", "forecast": "", "previous": "-0.1", "revised": "", "period": "月", "calendar_type": "FD", "subscribe_status": false, "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/DE142208/overview", "assets": "fx,bd", "foresight": ""}, {"id": 1590772, "public_date": 1788760800, "observati